{
  "version": 1,
  "readme": [
    "sample-picking \u2014 where samples come from, and choosing them.",
    "",
    "Every sample-based synth reads the host's library: the folders of",
    "static/samples/ (in nllc/static/samples \u2014 lilypad links to it), listed by",
    "/samples/manifest.json. Add a folder, and it's there \u2014 no code change.",
    "",
    "  percsampler  reads kicks/ snares/ hats/ percs/ \u2014 per_category files from",
    "               each, pitch = slot (kicks 0.., snares next, \u2026). `categories=`",
    "               loads only some, so one kit can be split over tracks \u2014 here",
    "               `kit` plays kicks+snares and `tops` hats+percs (own reverb).",
    "  sampler      any files, in a list; slot n plays on pitch n (`chops`).",
    "  granular     one recording from any folder (`texture`, from foley/).",
    "",
    "A fresh one picks at random; a saved session pins the files it landed on.",
    "In lilypad, select a track: the inspector's SAMPLES section has a picker",
    "(\u25b6 to listen) for every slot. The console equivalent, quoted for spaces:",
    "  /chops samples=\"kicks/CLAUDE - kick03.wav,percs/CLAUDE - glitch02.wav\"",
    "  /texture folder=foley      /texture sample=random",
    "  /kit samples=random        roll a new kit (keeps categories)"
